gz_ros2_control: world reset support (gz-sim ISystemReset) for the GazeboSimROS2ControlPlugin.
Adapted from a sibling project's patch; applies to the pinned lyrical branch (see ThirdParty/VERSIONS.md).
Without it, a gz world reset (/world/<w>/control reset, or ROS 2 Simulation Interfaces ResetSimulation)
destroys and reloads the plugin, and the new controller manager blocks the simulation thread.
Applied in the submodule's working tree by `./revolve build simulator` (components/simulator/build.sh).

